Z||000014||Jake_Dragon||09-09-2001||04:02 PM||||New Tires.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/icons/icon14.gif"> <BR>If you’re having that much of a problem with wet pavement it is only time till you meet up with an unmovable object.<P>I had the same thing going on and met up with a tree.<BR>||||reg||1
